  "notes": "Boot a Safe Cracker ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open and built-in mechanisms disabled, open T.4 SOLENOID TEST in its Repeat mode and step through every item with Up, taking four frames 0.25 s apart at each item because the ROM blinks the item name. The ROM pulses the shown driver repeatedly, so each item pairs the printed name and wires with the public solenoid that changes.",
